msgstr "فشل اكتشاف المشغّلات. لم تبدأ أيّ معاملة جديدة."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:240
#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:393
msgid "PackageKit is unavailable. Driver detection is still available."
msgstr "PackageKit غير متاح. ما زال اكتشاف المشغّلات متاحًا."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:249
msgid "This PackageKit version is not supported for applying driver changes."
msgstr "إصدارة PackageKit هذه غير مدعومة لتطبيق تغييرات المشغّلات."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:251
msgid "PackageKit is busy. Wait for the other package operation to finish."
msgstr "PackageKit مشغول. انتظر انتهاء عملية الحزم الأخرى."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:273
#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/packagekit.py:433
msgid "The PackageKit service disconnected."
msgstr "انقطع الاتصال بخدمة PackageKit."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:414
msgid "Preparing driver changes..."
msgstr "يجهّز تغييرات المشغّلات..."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:531
msgid ""
"PackageKit proposed a package downgrade. This version cannot apply this plan "
"safely."
msgstr ""
"اقترح PackageKit الرجوع بحزمة إلى إصدارة أقدم. لا يمكن لهذه الإصدارة تطبيق "
"هذه الخطة بأمان."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:533
msgid ""
"PackageKit reported an untrusted package. No further transaction was started."
msgstr "أبلغ PackageKit عن حزمة غير موثوقة. لم تبدأ أيّ معاملة أخرى."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:539
msgid ""
"PackageKit proposed additional removals outside the confirmed driver plan."
msgstr "اقترح PackageKit إزالات إضافية خارج خطة المشغّلات المؤكَّدة."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:541
msgid "A package selected for removal changed version. Review the plan again."
msgstr "تغيّرت إصدارة حزمة مختارة للإزالة. راجع الخطة مجدّدًا."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:547
msgid ""
"A target package changed version or architecture. Review the detected plan "
"again."
msgstr "تغيّرت إصدارة حزمة مستهدفة أو معماريتها. راجع الخطة المكتشفة مجدّدًا."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:550
msgid ""
"This driver requires a Secure Boot flow that is not supported by this "
"version."
msgstr "يتطلّب هذا المشغّل مسار Secure Boot لا تدعمه هذه الإصدارة."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:552
msgid "PackageKit could not safely simulate all planned changes."
msgstr "تعذّر على PackageKit محاكاة كلّ التغييرات المخطّط لها بأمان."

#: usr/lib/mainuan/mainuan-gestao-drivers/mainuan_drivers/backend/transactions/execution.py:554
